{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10377","headline":"同羣公宿开善寺赠陈十六所居 · 高适","name":"同羣公宿开善寺赠陈十六所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驾车出人境，避暑投僧家。\n裴回龙象侧，始见香林花。\n读书不及经，饮酒不胜茶。\n知君悟此道，所未搜袈裟。\n谈空忘外物，持诫破诸邪。\n则是无心地，相看唯月华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}